  "steps": [
    "Prep the palak: wash the spinach leaves thoroughly and pat them completely dry.",
    "Make the batter: mix besan, haldi, chilli powder, coriander powder, garam masala, cumin powder, salt and water to form a smooth, slightly thick batter.",
    "Coat the leaves: dip and coat each spinach leaf evenly in the batter.",
    "Air fry: air fry at 180°C for 8–10 minutes until crispy.",
    "Assemble: break the crispy palak leaves into bite-sized pieces in a bowl.",
    "Add toppings: top with Greek yoghurt, sprouts, onions, pomegranate, green chutney and mithi chutney.",
    "Serve: serve immediately while the palak is still crisp."
